  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "marian.liberation.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "契約を終わらせる夜。マリアンの契約書には、一見、彼女に優しい条項があった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「治療の結果に関する責任は、すべて所有者に帰属する」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼女は、責任を負わなくていい。——その代わり、判断も、しなくていい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.quc8xa",
      "speakerName": "マリアン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "この条項に、私は、守られてきました。治す判断を、いつも誰かのせいに、できたので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.quc8xa",
      "speakerName": "マリアン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……ですが、もう分かっています。判断を手放すことと、楽になることは、違う。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "判を押す。責任転嫁の条項が、すっと消える。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "これからは、治すのも、治さないのも、祈る範囲も、全部、彼女の判断で、彼女の責任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "優しい檻の扉が、静かに、音もなく開いた。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "marian.liberation.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.quc8xa",
      "speakerName": "マリアン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "怖い、です。今も。たぶん、これからも、ずっと。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.quc8xa",
      "speakerName": "マリアン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……ですが、怖いまま、選びます。それが、あの練習の、卒業試験なので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.quc8xa",
      "speakerName": "マリアン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "ミミさん。一つ、お願いが。……隣で、脈を、測っていてくれますか。私の。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "いつも測る側の手首が、そっと差し出された。私は見よう見まねで、指を三本、当てた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "速い。耳が、なぜか、じんとする。診断するまでもなく、緊張の脈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "でも、確かに、生きて、選ぼうとしている脈だった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……診断結果、出ました。かなり緊張してます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "びっくりするくらい。でも、悪い脈じゃないです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "これはたぶん、何かが、始まる前の脈です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼女は小さく笑って、「良い診断です。及第点」と言った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "師匠は厳しい。夜の霊安室の花が、少しだけ揺れた。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "marian.liberation.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今夜の締めくくりは、処方箋を書くように、丁寧に選ぶ。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "marian.liberation.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "marian.liberation.choice.001",
          "label": "責任転嫁の条項を消し、祈る範囲を本人へ返す",
          "result": "契約書の余白に、彼女は書き足した。「治療方針は、マリアンが決める。相談は、歓迎する」責任を引き受けた字は、思ったよりのびのびしていた。空のベッドの前で、彼女は囁いた。「見ていてください。ちゃんと、選べるようになりました」",
          "intent": "判断の権利ごと、本人に返す",
          "promise": "所有者名を消し、本人が自分の名で次の試合を選べるようにする。",
          "memory": "余白の「相談は、歓迎する」の一行を、二人とも気に入っている。",
          "tone": "defiant",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "marian"
              },
              "mode": "add",
